%%% @system #z/ref area::zorg/system
Query and template fixture
%%%

- @system/queries/today #z/query title::Today query query::due:<=today
  Runs a LIST query for work due today.

- @system/queries/inbox #z/query title::Inbox query
  ```swog
  #z/inbox -did:*
  ```

- @system/templates/todo #z/tmpl title::Todo capture dest::inbox.z
  ```zorg-template
  - @{{id}} #z/todo [ ] do::{{date}} source::{{source}} {{title}}
    {{body}}
  ```
